{"id":70376,"date":"2025-10-28T08:50:36","date_gmt":"2025-10-28T07:50:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70376"},"modified":"2026-10-25T00:11:44","modified_gmt":"2026-10-24T23:11:44","slug":"sao-silvestre-vermoim","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-vermoim\/","title":{"rendered":"4\u00aa Crediversos S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vermoim 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">4\u00aa Crediversos S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vermoim 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>4\u00aa Crediversos S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vermoim 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>12 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com centro nevr\u00e1lgico, partidas e chegadas junto ao <strong>Sal\u00e3o Paroquial de Vermoim<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>. A tarde competitiva inicia-se \u00e0s <strong>15:00<\/strong> com as provas dos escal\u00f5es jovens, seguindo-se ao cair da noite, \u00e0s <strong>18:30<\/strong>, a corrida principal de 10 km e, \u00e0s <strong>18:35<\/strong>, a caminhada solid\u00e1ria de 5 km.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Integrada no <strong>Circuito das S\u00e3o Silvestres de Famalic\u00e3o by Crediversos<\/strong> e no <strong>Circuito Jovem das S\u00e3o Silvestres de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong>, a prova une quatro freguesias vizinhas do vale do Ave \u2014 <strong>Vermoim, Pousada de Saramagos, Ruiv\u00e3es e Castel\u00f5es<\/strong> \u2014 num tra\u00e7ado de estrada vibrante. O programa inclui cinco corridas de forma\u00e7\u00e3o (500 m a 3.000 m), uma <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> de cariz solid\u00e1rio (limitada a 200 inscritos) e a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (limitada a 800 atletas), oferecendo t-shirt oficial, abastecimentos e pr\u00e9mio finisher.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>AMVE \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Moinho de Vermoim<\/strong>, com o apoio da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong>, das Juntas de Freguesia locais e arbitragem da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Braga<\/strong>, a corrida de 10 km distribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios \u00e0 geral absoluta masculina e feminina (100 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba, 50 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba e 25 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba), al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9us por escal\u00e3o, por equipas e \u00e0 equipa mais numerosa. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Sal\u00e3o Paroquial de Vermoim, Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o, Braga<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tec