 &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 12 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 9,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 01\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 11,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (02\/11 a 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 12,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/11 a 06\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padd